  "authorization": "On October 16, 2026 the owner, Dias, asked in the working session to \"run the full deeper sweep\" of the zodiacs.org \"AI-website tells\" design pass that followed PR #764, and to \"include icons on this page too - https://zodiacs.org/tools/\". This one-time exact-path exception covers only the listed files and only these changes. Visual and design: tracked all-caps labels set in the brand sans in sentence case; flat panels with hover and focus feedback instead of static bezels and gradients; decorative kickers above headlines turned into section back-links or datelines, or removed where they only repeated the page name; transform-only hover and disclosure motion behind prefers-reduced-motion; an inline EN language tag for English-only navigation destinations; pastel tool discs on the tools pages; lavender hues moved off non-sign tools. Punctuation: em and en dashes in live consumer copy rewritten with commas, periods, colons, parentheses or range words, in every released locale; wording changes are limited to letter case after a new sentence, range words such as \"to\" or \"del ... al\" where a dash joined two values, and the rare connective a sentence needs to stay grammatical. Dates: the frontmatter \"updated\" and editorial dates the sitemap-dates check requires for the pages whose copy changed. No meaning, facts, links or numbers change. Legal and disclosure pages, the Registry wing, the SDK and published dated editions are not edited."
